<title>FINLAND: KERA'S INCAP SETS 44 MARKKA PER SHARE ISSUE PRICE.</title>
<headline>KERA'S INCAP SETS 44 MARKKA PER SHARE ISSUE PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronic and furniture subcontractor Incap Oy said in a statement on Wednesday its initial public offering would be priced at 44 markka per share.  </p>
<p>Incap said it would offer 800,000 shares instead of the initially planned 600,000.</p>
<p>Institutional investors would be offered 600,000 shares, and 200,000 shares would be offered to the public, it said.</p>
<p>Incap is controlled by the state's regional development fund Kera Oy, which through the issue would reduce its ownership to 43 percent from the current 79 percent if all the shares are sold in the offering, Incap said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
